{"id":"u-b1142721-6237-4aea-8ac5-c1ac4379b63e","src":"community","title":"Recovery Bro Split","author":"Chris L.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/VPyW5R-recovery-bro-split","desc":"The Recovery Bro Split is a focused 4-week program designed for lifters looking to recover and heal from (minor) upper body and lower back injuries while still hitting all major muscle groups. With 5 training days, this split allows you to balance intensity and rest, ensuring your muscles are primed for growth. Each workout targets specific areas, promoting strength gains while minimizing fatigue. Perfect for those who want to recharge and come back stronger, this program is your ticket to effective recovery and renewed energy in the gym.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-18T18:32:27.491Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest & triceps","Back & forearms","Legs (quad focus)","Shoulders & biceps","Legs (ham focus)"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}],"note":"2 clicks above flat"},{"n":"Cable Crossover","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Assisted)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":18,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single Arm Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":2}],"note":"pushdown"}]},{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Wide Grip Pull-Up","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}],"note":"WIDE grip"},{"n":"Chin-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"rpe":10,"x":3}],"note":"use as a mechanical dropset to the wide, neutral pulldowns"}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"rpe":9,"x":3}],"note":"get a good trap squeeze at top"},{"n":"Helms Row","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"rpe":10,"x":2}],"note":"focus on using lats"},{"n":"Kroc Row","sets":[{"lo":18,"hi":23,"rpe":10}],"note":"use as helms row finisher, 2nd s